                <pb facs="0797" n="699" xml:id="pg699"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Everett to Mr. Hay</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-11-06"><hi rendition="#italic">November 6,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Everett reports the receipt of a telegram from the minister for foreign
                    affairs of Honduras to the effect that his Government has ordered the payment of
                    the indemnity demanded in the Pears case, and that immediate remittance will be
                    made to Mr. Everett.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
